DATA — separate terms

The MIT licence above covers this project's own CODE only. The bundled data is
governed by its own licences and is included for reproducibility and educational,
non-commercial use:

- Open Food Facts data (data/raw/openfoodfacts_products_raw.csv and derivatives)
  is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL). Attribution to Open Food
  Facts and its contributors is required. See https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/
  and https://openfoodfacts.org .

- BigBasket catalogue data (data/raw/bigbasket_products_raw.csv and derivatives)
  is a public product catalogue, used here for educational, non-commercial
  analysis only.

- Nutri-Score is a nutrition-labelling scheme of Santé publique France.

This project is an independent academic / portfolio analysis and is not
affiliated with, or endorsed by, any of these organisations. See docs/sources.md.
